Package: mlqt
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: M Dempsey Ltd <mike@dempsey.me.uk>
Homepage: https://github.com/mdempse1/MLQT
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: git, subversion
Description: Modelica Library Quality Tool
 MLQT manages Modelica libraries under revision control. It reviews and commits
 changes, pulls updates, creates branches and pushes to Git and SVN, and runs
 static analysis over Modelica source: dependency impact, style rules, spell
 checking and code formatting.
 .
 This package carries all three tools:
 .
  * MLQT, the desktop application (mlqt-gui, or the MLQT entry in the menu)
  * mlqt, the headless CLI that style-checks a library in CI
  * mlqt-mcp-server, the Model Context Protocol server for AI agents
 .
 The .NET runtime is bundled, so nothing needs to be added to apt for it.
